%rec: default
# unique_items.rec: Heaven & Hell's unique items, one record each (the fields are D1's, see files/mods/d1/data/
# unique_items.rec). A magic item whose base has the unique_base below may turn out to be the unique instead
# (1 in 50, a unique monster's drop 1 in 6), once its item level reaches min_level, and never twice; the bosses
# in enemies.rec drop theirs outright. Each draws with its own icon, item.<internal_name> in icons/items.rec.

